      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتسج</span></b>  <i>It became drawn, collected,</i> or
<i>gathered, together: became drawn and joined,</i> or
<i>adjoined,</i> to another thing. (L.) See 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتسج</span>
<i>It</i> (a piece of cloth, or a garment,) <i>became woven.</i>
(TA.)

